# Route: guide 52 of 53 of the simulator's completionist route for NightElf
# (1445 of 1459 eligible quests, 164.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 60 to
# 60, 39 quests, 3.3 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Burning Steppes, Tanaris, Un'Goro Crater, Thousand Needles, The
# Hinterlands, Stormwind City, Winterspring, Moonglade, Ironforge, The
# Barrens, Stranglethorn Vale): Morgan's Vigil -> Ruins of Thaurissan ->
# Morgan's Vigil -> Ruins of Thaurissan -> Morgan's Vigil -> Gadgetzan -> Lost
# Rigger Cove -> Fire Plume Ridge -> Lakkari Tar Pits -> Gadgetzan -> Abyssal
# Sands -> Steamwheedle Port -> The Shimmering Flats -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): It's Dangerous to Go Alone (3962;
# Blazerunner 56); An Ambassador of Evil (762; Ambassador Infernus 42).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Dark Iron Legacy (3802), A Taste of Flame (4024), The
